    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d604">

                <pb facs="0594" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg520"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Perry</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 79.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-03-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 23, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatch of the 20th of February, No.
                    168, has been received, and also your despatch of the 25th of the same month,
                    No. 169. In my No. 74 I gave you the determination by which this government
                    would abide in the case of the pirate Stonewall, at least until a change should
                    come over the situation of the vessel.</p>
                <p>It is now, therefore, only necessary to say that all your proceedings, as
                    subsequently reported, are fully approved and heartily commended. Our naval
                    force in European waters will soon be increased; but I cannot learn that this is
                    likely to take place early enough for a contingency in the case of the
                    Stonewall.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Horatio</hi> J. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Perry,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.,
                            Madrid.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
